Subject: [PATCH] Add effect-prediction modules: VEP plugins, Denise's
 criteria, AlphaGenome, Sei, ISM design

- annotate_vep: optional SIFT/PolyPhen and VEP plugins (dbNSFP, AlphaMissense,
  REVEL, dbscSNV, MaxEntScan, SpliceAI) from vep.* config; existing configs unchanged
- variant_effects: classify_variant_effects.py applies Denise's thresholds on the
  target-gene MANE transcript (LoF, damaging missense, splicing, optional ExPectoSC)
- alphagenome: rewritten; non-coding variants, SNVs via the AlphaGenome Atlas,
  indels and Atlas misses via the model API; batched, cached, breast-ontology and
  target-gene filtered; API key from resources/API_KEY or $ALPHAGENOME_API_KEY
- sei: VCF prep, chromatin prediction (CPU or GPU resources), sequence-class scores,
  merge onto the effects table with Selene ref_match QC
- alphagenome_ism: design skeleton (regions + Atlas ISM runnable, element calling and
  Sei steps stubbed), docs/ism_sei_design.md
- Snakefile: include modules in dependency order
- Remove hardcoded AlphaGenome API key from score_variants_alphagenome.py and notebooks

